5,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited to play! I wonder who the werewolf is? Maybe it's someone we'd never expect!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,It is certainly a curious game. We must all remain observant and calm to find the truth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope we can find them quickly. I don't like the idea of someone being a werewolf.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Daisuke, let's not be too frightened. We are all here together, and I'm sure we can handle this with a smile.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Let's try to stay positive and help each other out while we figure this out.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're being so serious! Do you already have a secret plan to catch the werewolf? Tell me, tell me!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"No plan yet, Rin. I simply believe that careful observation of everyone's behavior is the most reliable way to proceed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think George is right. But it's hard to know what to look for... I'm just nervous.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It's quite alright to be nervous, dear. Just take a deep breath and listen to your heart; sometimes the simplest feelings are the most honest.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"That's very true, Shizue. Maybe we should all just share how we're feeling as the game goes on; it might help us spot something unusual.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"That's a great idea, Midori! I feel super energetic and ready to solve this mystery! Who else wants to share?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"I shall continue to observe. For now, I feel a sense of duty to ensure we do not make any hasty mistakes in our judgments.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel a bit overwhelmed, but I'll try my best to help everyone. I just hope I don't get in the way.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"You are doing wonderfully just by being here, Daisuke. Your kindness is a strength, and we are all very happy to have you with us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I feel quite calm, though I'm curious to see how everyone's perspectives shift once the first night passes. Let's keep supporting one another.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I wonder what will happen tonight! I'll be dreaming of clues! Good luck everyone, and please be safe!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,Indeed. Let us hope for a peaceful night and that we may find clarity when the sun rises tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll try to sleep well. Goodnight, everyone. Please... please be careful.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sweet dreams, everyone. I shall be praying for your safety and for a gentle morning to greet us all.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. Let's all get some rest and meet again tomorrow with clear minds.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
