31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning everyone! Did anyone have any spooky dreams? I'm ready to find that werewolf today!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"Good morning, Rin. I slept soundly, though I suspect the werewolf did not. We must now be very careful with our words and observations.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm glad everyone is okay. But I can't help but feel scared... what if the werewolf is someone we trust?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That is a frightening thought, isn't it, Daisuke? But remember, we have each other, and we will find the truth together with patience and kindness.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think we should start by seeing if anyone noticed anything strange or has any suspicions, even if they're just small feelings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't have any suspicions yet, but I'm watching everyone! @George, you're always so calm, it's almost too calm! Do you think that's a clue?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"My composure is simply my nature, Rin. Being overly emotional often clouds one's judgment, which is exactly what a werewolf would hope for in this village.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I guess that makes sense. But sometimes people hide things by acting normal... I'm just not sure who to believe.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult position to be in, isn't it? However, we must trust one another while remaining mindful. Perhaps we can look for patterns in how we speak.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That's a good point, Shizue. @Daisuke, you seem very anxious, but that's normal for you. Is there anything specific that's making you feel more uneasy today?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I just think it's exciting! But @Daisuke, you're shaking a little! Are you hiding a big secret, or are you just really, really scared?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"Rin, please do not tease the boy. His anxiety is well-known to us all, and pressing him so aggressively will not yield the truth we seek.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm not hiding anything! I'm just... I'm just really scared that we might make a mistake and hurt someone innocent. Please don't be mad at me.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"No one is mad at you, dear. Your compassion for others is a beautiful thing, and it shows how much you care for this village.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we should focus on the facts. Since no one has come forward with a role, we have to rely on our intuition. Does anyone feel like someone is acting out of character?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't think anyone is acting weird yet, but we have to vote soon! I'm still leaning towards George because he's so mysterious! What do you guys think?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"My mystery is merely a reflection of my age and experience, Rin. To vote based on a personality trait would be a grave error that only benefits the werewolf.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want to vote for anyone if I'm not sure. But if Rin is suspicious of George... I don't know, I can't decide.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I feel it is important that we do not rush into a decision based on mere suspicion. However, we must also be brave enough to face the truth for the sake of our village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Since we have to make a choice, maybe we should look at who is trying to deflect the most. George, you're very logical, but you're also very quick to dismiss Rin's curiosity.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
